---
import ProjectLayout from "../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro";
---

<ProjectLayout
  title="ICAM Grand Paris Sud"
  category="Education | Engineering Degree"
  year="2024 | 2027"
  description="Engineering degree at ICAM Grand Paris Sud through an apprenticeship programme focused on mechanical engineering, industrial systems and project management."
>

  <p slot="intro" class="hero-intro">
    Engineering degree completed through an apprenticeship programme,
    combining academic training with continuous industrial experience
    in mechanical engineering, machine tools and project management.
  </p>


  <div class="detail-section">

    <p class="detail-index">
      01 | Programme
    </p>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Engineering through practice.
      </h2>

      <p>
        I joined ICAM Grand Paris Sud in 2024 as part of the engineering
        apprenticeship programme.
      </p>

      <p>
        The curriculum combines academic courses with long-term industrial
        experience, allowing technical concepts to be directly applied
        to real engineering projects.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="detail-section">

    <p class="detail-index">
      02 | Main Fields
    </p>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        A multidisciplinary engineering foundation.
      </h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Mechanical engineering</li>
        <li>Industrial systems</li>
        <li>Mechatronics</li>
        <li>Manufacturing</li>
        <li>Project management</li>
        <li>Automation</li>
        <li>Engineering methods</li>
      </ul>

    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="detail-section">

    <p class="detail-index">
      03 | Apprenticeship
    </p>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Learning inside an industrial environment.
      </h2>

      <p>
        My engineering degree is completed through an apprenticeship
        at Fives Machining, where I work on mechanical design,
        machine-tool development and technical project follow-up.
      </p>

      <p>
        This dual academic and industrial approach has allowed me
        to progressively move from mechanical design activities
        toward broader project management responsibilities.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="detail-section">

    <p class="detail-index">
      04 | International Mobility
    </p>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Engineering in an international context.
      </h2>

      <p>
        As part of the programme, I completed an academic mobility
        semester at the Silesian University of Technology in Gliwice,
        Poland.
      </p>

      <p>
        The semester included courses related to environmental analysis,
        full life-cycle impact assessment and IoT communications,
        while strengthening my ability to work in an international
        academic environment.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="detail-section">

    <p class="detail-index">
      05 | Skills Developed
    </p>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        From technical design to project coordination.
      </h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Mechanical system design</li>
        <li>Technical problem solving</li>
        <li>Industrial project coordination</li>
        <li>Technical communication</li>
        <li>Risk analysis</li>
        <li>Team collaboration</li>
        <li>International adaptability</li>
      </ul>

    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="detail-section">

    <p class="detail-index">
      06 | Languages
    </p>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Working across languages.
      </h2>

      <p>
        French | Native
      </p>

      <p>
        English | B2 | TOEIC 910/990
      </p>

      <p>
        Spanish | Academic knowledge
      </p>

      <p>
        Polish | Basic learning
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="detail-section">

    <p class="detail-index">
      07 | Direction
    </p>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Building toward research and advanced engineering.
      </h2>

      <p>
        My engineering studies have progressively reinforced my interest
        in robotics, advanced mechanical systems, biomechanics
        and research-oriented engineering.
      </p>

      <p>
        I aim to continue developing this profile through advanced
        R&D projects and potentially doctoral research after graduation.
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>

</ProjectLayout>